{"key":"lamia","name":"Lamia","accent":"#ff2a20","based":"Friedman BE-100 Deluxe","intro":"Lamia keeps her gothic cathedral look and is now a Friedman BE-100 Deluxe. Four CHANNEL buttons pick Clean, BE and HBE like the real amp, plus EL34, the one capture the pack marks as [POW] instead of [AMP]. These are full-rig captures, so the MIC button picks how the cab was recorded: SM57, SM58 or a blend of the two.","notes":["Gain steps through the real captures on each channel: Clean goes Tender Clean → Rock, BE goes Man in the Cogs → Eddie → TEST, and HBE goes Mammoth → Tallica. \"TEST\" is the name the pack gives it.","Each channel remembers its own Gain, EQ and Master, like separate channels on the real amp.","Full rig: the cab is inside every capture, so the plugin should bypass its own cab section while Lamia is loaded.","Every setting exists with all three mics (24 files), so MIC never runs out of options."],"W":1767,"H":778,"skins":[{"id":"lamia_be","ptrOff":false}],"knobs":[{"label":"Gain","b":[201,567,85,85],"o":[50.259,49.682],"c":[243.7,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.7},{"label":"Bass","b":[365,567,85,85],"o":[49.706,49.682],"c":[407.2,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.45},{"label":"Middle","b":[528,567,85,85],"o":[50.341,49.682],"c":[570.8,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.4},{"label":"Treble","b":[692,567,85,85],"o":[49.8,49.682],"c":[734.3,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.55},{"label":"Presence","b":[855,567,85,85],"o":[50.435,49.682],"c":[897.9,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.5},{"label":"Resonance","b":[1019,567,85,85],"o":[49.882,49.682],"c":[1061.4,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.6},{"label":"Master","b":[1182,567,85,85],"o":[50.518,49.682],"c":[1224.9,609.2],"r":33.1,"v":0.42}],"leds":{"ch1":[1340,566,21,19],"ch2":[1395,566,21,19],"ch3":[1450,566,21,19],"ch4":[1505,566,22,19],"mic1":[1562,566,20,19],"mic2":[1576,566,20,19],"mic3":[1590,566,20,19]},"buttons":{"ch1":[1334.9,595.6,34.0,23.6],"ch2":[1390.3,595.6,34.0,23.6],"ch3":[1445.7,595.6,34.0,23.6],"ch4":[1501.0,595.6,34.0,23.6],"mic":[1571.2,595.6,34.0,23.6]},"powe